#: includes/admin/class-access-control-settings.php:54
msgid ""
"This access control system allows to define granular roles and permissions "
"for different functionalities of the platform"
msgstr ""
"Este sistema de control de acceso permite definir funciones y permisos "
"granulares para las distintas funcionalidades de la plataforma"

