msgid "Who can manage questions?"
msgstr "¿Quién puede gestionar las preguntas?"

#: includes/admin/class-access-control-settings.php:70
msgid "Grant premium features to administrators?"
msgstr "¿Conceder funciones premium a los administradores?"

#: includes/admin/class-access-control-settings.php:107
msgid ""
"This feature allows specific roles with at least the capability to publish "
"posts to access the question management (viewing, editing, and deleting "
"questions). However, access to plugin settings is restricted to "
"administrators only."
msgstr ""
"Esta función permite a determinados roles con al menos la capacidad de "
